@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #28594F
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F1F7F3
skinparam classBorderColor #456B63
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title UC-05 Review teacher application: valid review submission
actor Administrator
participant AdminController
participant "review : Forms.Review" as Review
participant TeacherService
participant JdbcTemplate
database "Local H2" as DB
note over Administrator, AdminController
Preconditions: administrator session, valid CSRF token,
existing teacher, and successful MVC field validation.
end note
Administrator -> AdminController : POST /admin/teachers/{id}/review
activate AdminController
AdminController -> Review : getStatus()
Review --> AdminController : status
AdminController -> Review : getFeedback()
Review --> AdminController : feedback
AdminController -> TeacherService : review(id, status, feedback)
activate TeacherService
TeacherService -> JdbcTemplate : update(parameterized SQL, status, feedback, id)
JdbcTemplate -> DB : UPDATE teacher_profile
DB --> JdbcTemplate : affected row count
JdbcTemplate --> TeacherService : row count
TeacherService --> AdminController : completed
 deActivate TeacherService
AdminController --> Administrator : redirect to record with confirmation
deactivate AdminController
note over TeacherService, DB
The transaction commits the update before success returns.
If no row matches, TeacherService raises a 404 response.
end note
@enduml
